# QUIZ APP — FOUR-PERSON MVP PRD

## Project Goal

Build a simple Mentimeter/Kahoot-inspired quiz application where:

1. A host creates a quiz.
2. The host adds multiple-choice questions.
3. The host publishes the quiz and receives a join code.
4. A participant joins using the code and enters their name.
5. The participant answers the questions.
6. The participant submits the quiz.
7. The backend calculates the score.
8. The participant sees their result.
9. Participants appear on a leaderboard.

The application must prioritize a complete working flow over advanced features.

