# 4.12 Backend Security Rules

Minimum requirements:

* Validate request bodies
* Validate IDs
* Validate quiz code
* Validate selected option
* Never trust frontend score
* Never send correct answers to participants
* Never expose environment secrets
* Prevent duplicate quiz submission
* Prevent invalid question/option relationships

